# Weekend Gap Guard needs NO secrets. Everything in the demo uses public, key-less endpoints:
#   - Binance Wallet Skills RWA endpoints (www.binance.com/bapi/defi/... "…/ai")
#   - public BSC JSON-RPC (default https://bsc-dataseed.bnbchain.org, override with `gapguard portfolio --rpc`)
#
# Optional and NOT verified live: gapguard/sources/web3_api.py implements the signed Binance Web3 API
# client exactly as the Authentication page describes, but we could not obtain a Developer Portal key
# during the hackathon (see docs/DEVELOPER_EXPERIENCE_REPORT.md). Nothing in the CLI reads these yet.
BINANCE_WEB3_API_KEY=
BINANCE_WEB3_SECRET_KEY=
